#10401
Wild Valley~
   You move slowly through the green vines and thick undergrowth that
cover the valley floor, and it seems that few have come this way in
ages.  Butterflies drift among the wildflowers.  To the west the land
rises out of the valley, and to the east the vegetation clears to reveal
a strange uprising of stone.
~
