#10402
Before the Dragon~
   You stand before the dragon Ancalador.  Though earth has filled in
the crevices between its limbs and huge oaks, dwarfed by the dragon
itself, have grown up there, you can still make out its petrified form:
the great head, the folded wings, the coils of its body stretching away
into the hillside.  A vague evil emanates from the stone that once lived
and terrorized nations long ago.  Its mouth gapes open to the east.
~
104 p 4
D1
The huge maw lies frozen in midsnarl.  You could find enough purchase
to scale the tongue and enter inside, should you want to.
~
~
