#10406
Further Down the Dragon's Throat~
   The tunnel begins to lose its steepness here and merely runs
eastward.  The shapes of what might be petrified muscles line the walls
in long, ridged bands, and the floor is ribbed like the inside of a
gullet.  It is unsettling to realize that you are walking through what
was once a living creature.  The throat climbs back up behind you.
