Stone Tunnel~
   This circular passage of stone gradually curves up towards a place of
great light and heat.  Its walls are smooth and faintly ridged, like the
inside of a great windpipe, and a warm breath of air flows steadily down
from above.  A junction lies to the south, and the passage climbs up
towards the dragon's lung.
