#10413
Ancalagor's Stomach~
   The dragon's throat ends here, opening into a huge cavern lit from
below by eerie, diffuse lights of yellow and green.  Even more amazing,
a wooden bridge spans the stalactite-roofed cavern!  A steep slope leads
down safely enough to the cavern floor, the bridge leads east, and the
tunnel lies west.
