#10428
The Dragon's Pancreas~
   You are in an oddly shaped chamber, what might have been some foul
organ of Ancalador.  A yellowish light fills the room from nowhere, as
if by the dragon's will alone.  The feeling of malignant evil is strong
here, and it is only made worse by the large sign overhead that reads
'Memento Mori', or in the common tongue, 'Remember to Die.'  A fissure
leads north, and exits are worked into the walls to the east and down.
