Ossuary of the Mute People~
   You stand in a low, round chamber carved deep in the stone of the
dragon.  Its walls are built entirely of skulls, thousands of them, each
set facing inward so that their empty eyes all rest on you.  Not one of
them has a jaw.  In the center of the floor a flat stone bears a long
inscription, and a narrow shaft leads back up toward the shrine above.
~
