inscription stone floor~
The inscription reads: "Here lie the Mute People, the first servants of
the Pale Priest. When the great wyrm Ancalador was struck to stone they
crept into his body to feast on what power remained, and the stone took
their tongues for their greed. They speak no more, yet they are not
gone. Remember, traveller: the debt is owed by all, and every sleep ends
in the dreamless one."
~
