#10498
Grand Temple of Terror~
   This shrine to terror could not be more aptly named.  Elaborate
drawings all around the room depict one terrifying act after another,
and the light is so bright that even when you close your eyes to shut
out the awful sights, you can still see them.  You want to run, but you
are mesmerized by the sheer horror of the place.  A giant pillar rises
in the center of the temple.  A passage leads south.
~
